### async

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"nominal async_python t =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Python = (fun () => global \"import asyncio\") : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'any'\n    )\ntype async_switch t =\n    {\n        Fsharp : $'Async<`t>'\n        Python : async_python t\n        Rust : $'std::pin::Pin<Box<dyn std::future::Future<Output = `t>>>'\n    }\nnominal async t = $'backend_switch `(async_switch t)'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  nominal async_python t =
      `(
          backend_switch `(()) `({}) {
              Python = (fun () => global "import asyncio") : () -> ()
          }
          $'' : $'any'
      )
  type async_switch t =
      {
          Fsharp : $'Async<`t>'
          Python : async_python t
          Rust : $'std::pin::Pin<Box<dyn std::future::Future<Output = `t>>>'
      }
  nominal async t = $'backend_switch `(async_switch t)'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

