### sleep

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl sleep (ms : i32) : async () =\n    run_target function\n        | Fsharp _\n        | TypeScript _ => fun () =>\n            ms |> $'Async.Sleep'\n        | Cuda _ => fun () =>\n            $'asyncio.sleep(!ms / 1000)'\n        | RustNative => fun () =>\n            $'Box::pin(async move { std::thread::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis((!ms as u64))) })' : async ()\n        | _ => fun () => null ()","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl sleep (ms : i32) : async () =
      run_target function
          | Fsharp _
          | TypeScript _ => fun () =>
              ms |> $'Async.Sleep'
          | Cuda _ => fun () =>
              $'asyncio.sleep(!ms / 1000)'
          | RustNative => fun () =>
              $'Box::pin(async move { std::thread::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis((!ms as u64))) })' : async ()
          | _ => fun () => null ()
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

