### catch'

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"// Native Rust: a panic in any poll (failwith panics) is the exception (`e` must be `exn`, the panic message).\ninl catch' forall t e. (a : async t) : async (choice2' t e) =\n    if rust.is_native ()\n    then\n        inl r = a |> catch_native\n        $'(!r)' : async (choice2' t e)\n    else\n        run_target function\n            | Fsharp _\n            | TypeScript _ => fun () =>\n                a |> $'Async.Catch'\n            | _ => fun () => null ()","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  // Native Rust: a panic in any poll (failwith panics) is the exception (`e` must be `exn`, the panic message).
  inl catch' forall t e. (a : async t) : async (choice2' t e) =
      if rust.is_native ()
      then
          inl r = a |> catch_native
          $'(!r)' : async (choice2' t e)
      else
          run_target function
              | Fsharp _
              | TypeScript _ => fun () =>
                  a |> $'Async.Catch'
              | _ => fun () => null ()
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

